>UIGridLayout.FillDirectionMaxCells</code></a></td>\n    <td>integer</td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIGridLayout/UIGridLayout.StartCorner\"><code>UIGridLayout.StartCorner</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/enum/StartCorner\"><code>StartCorner</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>UIPageLayout</h3>\n<table size=\"small\">\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Property</th>\n    <th width=\"40%\">Type</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIPageLayout/UIPageLayout.Animated\"><code>UIPageLayout.Animated</code></a></td>\n    <td>boolean</td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIPageLayout/UIPageLayout.Circular\"><code>UIPageLayout.Circular</code></a></td>\n    <td>boolean</td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIPageLayout/UIPageLayout.EasingDirection\"><code>UIPageLayout.EasingDirection</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/enum/EasingDirection\"><code>EasingDirection</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIPageLayout/UIPageLayout.EasingStyle\"><code>UIPageLayout.EasingStyle</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/enum/EasingStyle\"><code>EasingStyle</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIPageLayout/UIPageLayout.GamepadInputEnabled\"><code>UIPageLayout.GamepadInputEnabled</code></a></td>\n    <td>boolean</td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIPageLayout/UIPageLayout.Padding\"><code>UIPageLayout.Padding</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/datatype/UDim\"><code>UDim</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIPageLayout/UIPageLayout.ScrollWheelInputEnabled\"><code>UIPageLayout.ScrollWheelInputEnabled</code></a></td>\n    <td>boolean</td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIPageLayout/UIPageLayout.TouchInputEnabled\"><code>UIPageLayout.TouchInputEnabled</code></a></td>\n    <td>boolean</td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIPageLayout/UIPageLayout.TweenTime\"><code>UIPageLayout.TweenTime</code></a></td>\n    <td>float</td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2>Size modifiers and constraints</h2>\n<h3>UIAspectRatioConstraint</h3>\n<table size=\"small\">\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Property</th>\n    <th width=\"40%\">Type</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIAspectRatioConstraint/UIAspectRatioConstraint.AspectRatio\"><code>UIAspectRatioConstraint.AspectRatio</code></a></td>\n    <td>float</td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIAspectRatioConstraint/UIAspectRatioConstraint.AspectType\"><code>UIAspectRatioConstraint.AspectType</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/enum/AspectType\"><code>AspectType</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIAspectRatioConstraint/UIAspectRatioConstraint.DominantAxis\"><code>UIAspectRatioConstraint.DominantAxis</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/enum/DominantAxis\"><code>DominantAxis</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>UISizeConstraint</h3>\n<table size=\"small\">\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Property</th>\n    <th width=\"40%\">Type</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UISizeConstraint/UISizeConstraint.MaxSize\"><code>UISizeConstraint.MaxSize</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/datatype/Vector2\"><code>Vector2</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UISizeConstraint/UISizeConstraint.MinSize\"><code>UISizeConstraint.MinSize</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/datatype/Vector2\"><code>Vector2</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>UITextSizeConstraint</h3>\n<table size=\"small\">\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Property</th>\n    <th width=\"40%\">Type</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UITextSizeConstraint/UITextSizeConstraint.MaxTextSize\"><code>UITextSizeConstraint.MaxTextSize</code></a></td>\n    <td>integer</td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UITextSizeConstraint/UITextSizeConstraint.MinTextSize\"><code>UITextSizeConstraint.MinTextSize</code></a></td>\n    <td>integer</td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>UIScale</h3>\n<table size=\"small\">\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Property</th>\n    <th width=\"40%\">Type</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIScale/UIScale.Scale\"><code>UIScale.Scale</code></a></td>\n    <td>float</td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>UIFlexItem</h3>\n<table size=\"small\">\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Property</th>\n    <th width=\"40%\">Type</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIFlexItem/UIFlexItem.FlexMode\"><code>UIFlexItem.FlexMode</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/enum/UIFlexMode\"><code>UIFlexMode</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIFlexItem/UIFlexItem.GrowRatio\"><code>UIFlexItem.GrowRatio</code></a></td>\n    <td>float</td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIFlexItem/UIFlexItem.ItemLineAlignment\"><code>UIFlexItem.ItemLineAlignment</code></a></td>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/enum/ItemLineAlignment\"><code>ItemLineAlignment</code></a></td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/UIFlexItem/UIFlexItem.ShrinkRatio\"><code>UIFlexItem.ShrinkRatio</code></a></td>\n    <td>float</td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>StyleQuery</h3>\n<p><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/StyleQuery\"><code>StyleQuery</code></a> lets you define conditional breakpoints (like container/media queries) that control when styles apply to the query's parent instance.</p>\n<table size=\"small\">\n<thead>\n <tr>\n  <th>Property</th>\n  <th width=\"40%\">Type</th>\n </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n <tr>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/StyleQuery/StyleQuery.AspectRatioRange\"><code>StyleQuery.AspectRatioRange</code></a></td>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/datatype/NumberRange\"><code>NumberRange</code></a></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/StyleQuery/StyleQuery.MaxSize\"><code>StyleQuery.MaxSize</code></a></td>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/datatype/Vector2\"><code>Vector2</code></a></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/StyleQuery/StyleQuery.MinSize\"><code>StyleQuery.MinSize</code></a></td>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/datatype/Vector2\"><code>Vector2</code></a></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/StyleQuery/StyleQuery.PreferredInputType\"><code>StyleQuery.PreferredInputType</code></a></td>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/enum/PreferredInput\"><code>PreferredInput</code></a></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/StyleQuery/StyleQuery.ReduceMotionEnabled\"><code>StyleQuery.ReduceMotionEnabled</code></a></td>\n  <td>boolean</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/class/StyleQuery/StyleQuery.ViewportDisplaySize\"><code>StyleQuery.ViewportDisplaySize</code></a></td>\n  <td><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/enum/DisplaySize\"><code>DisplaySize</code></a></td>\n </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","kid":{"simple":"This page is a big lookup list of which UI objects and which of their properties can be controlled by UI styling. If you write a style rule for a property that is not on this list, it will not work. Use it like a dictionary: when a style is not applying, check here first. Roblox says more properties may be added over time.","analogy":"It is like the list of toppings a pizza shop offers. You can only order what is on the menu; asking for something not listed will not get you anything.","keyPoints":["The list is grouped into UI objects, appearance modifiers, layout structures, and size modifiers and constraints.","`GuiObject` properties like `AnchorPoint`, `BackgroundColor3`, `BackgroundTransparency`, `Position`, `Rotation`, and `Size` can be styled, and most UI objects inherit these.","Text objects like `TextLabel` and `TextButton` can have their font, `Text`, `TextColor3`, `TextSize`, wrapping, and alignment styled.","Image objects like `ImageLabel` can have `Image`, `ImageColor3`, `ImageTransparency`, `ScaleType`, and 9-slice settings like `SliceCenter` styled.","Appearance modifiers like `UICorner`, `UIGradient`, `UIPadding`, `UIShadow`, and `UIStroke` can be styled too.","Layouts like `UIListLayout` and `UIGridLayout`, and constraints like `UIAspectRatioConstraint`, `UISizeConstraint`, `UITextSizeConstraint`, `UIScale`, and `UIFlexItem` are included.","`StyleQuery` has its own condition properties such as `MinSize`, `MaxSize`, `AspectRatioRange`, `PreferredInputType`, `ReduceMotionEnabled`, and `ViewportDisplaySize`."],"terms":{"property":"A setting on an object, like `Size` or `TextColor3`. Styling can only change the properties listed here.","abstract class":"A kind of base class you never insert directly. `GuiObject` is abstract; Frames, labels, and buttons are built on top of it and get its properties.","inherit":"Get features from a parent class. Because `TextButton` inherits from `GuiObject`, it also has `Size` and `Position`.","appearance modifier":"A small add-on object that changes how its parent looks, like `UICorner` for rounded corners or `UIStroke` for an outline.","layout structure":"An object like `UIListLayout` that arranges sibling UI items automatically in a list or grid.","constraint":"An object that limits size, like `UISizeConstraint` keeping a frame between a `MinSize` and `MaxSize`.","breakpoint":"A point where the style changes, like \"when the container is at least 400 pixels wide, switch to the big layout\".","type":"What kind of value a property takes, like boolean (true or false), float (a decimal like 0.5), `Color3` (a color), or `UDim2` (a UI size or position)."},"watchOut":["Trying to style a property that is not in the tables. It will be ignored, so check this page or use a script instead.","Using the wrong value type in a rule, like a number where a `Color3` is expected. Match the type shown in the table.","Assuming the list never changes. Roblox adds support over time, so check back if something you need is missing."]}}